      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Chase DeLauter has been named an AL Silver Slugger Award winner. He's the first Cleveland rookie to earn the honor and the first Cleveland player not named José Ramírez to do so since Carlos Santana in 2019.",
      "likes": 70,
      "reposts": 10,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-17T23:34:30.219Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2k7f242ck2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "チェイス・デローターがア・リーグのシルバースラッガー賞を受賞。クリーブランドの新人としては初、2019年のカルロス・サンタナ以来、ホセ・ラミレス以外の選手としても初の受賞🎉"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Down in the Dominican Winter League (LIDOM) … and I can not stress enough that this is a tweet about the Dominican Winter League (LIDOM): Vladimir Guerrero Jr. was traded from Toros del Este to Tigres del Licey. Guerrero has not played in LIDOM games since 2020-21. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 40,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-18T01:51:36.645Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2kh27gnh22p",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Shatkins!",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "buck16.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "They might try change the name to the Tigres Centre, but it’ll always be called the LIDOMe",
          "likes": 0,
