      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "How I’m pulling up to blow 90 mph gyroballs past some kids after a couple steady eddies during BP",
          "likes": 9,
          "author": "oriolebird.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "let’s go hit some tanks!",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "chrpngbrd.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Memorial Stadium, the tarp crew had to arrive on Saturdays at 7AM for games that started at 730PM. We used to play 100-inning wiffleball games in the bullpen, hitting balls off the big scoreboard. 🖤🧡⚾️",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "fistsofham.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "One of my favorite parts of the park was that picnic area. It was a nice spot to eat before the game, there were lots of tables, and it was even shaded. It's a bummer they're getting rid of it for a play area. I have a kid, I get the need for things to do when they're bored, but it's still a bummer.",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "juliesax.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "酔っ払った客が球をぶっ飛ばして、本物のフィールドまで届かせる日が待ちきれない"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins needed a starting catcher this offseason. Surprising that it’s Ryan Jeffers, but reinforces their decision not to trade him in August. Jeffers becomes the highest-paid player on the Twins’ roster for next year too.",
      "likes": 24,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-17T21:27:43.437Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jycdpk7k2l",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズは今オフ、正捕手が必要だった。ライアン・ジェファーズというのは意外だが、8月に放出しなかった判断を裏付ける形に。来季のツインズでは最高年俸の選手にもなる。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Other Rule 5 / protection notes: • Last year, 12/13 players selected were pitchers. For today's deadline, think pitchers. • When the #BlueJays selected Spencer Miles last year, I pulled up his MiLB page and said \"There's no fucking way it's this guy\" ... So, you never know!",
      "likes": 26,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-17T17:24:21.811Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jkp6jats2m",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ルール5ドラフト/40人枠のその他のメモ:・昨年指名された13人のうち12人が投手。今日の期限は投手に注目。・#BlueJaysが昨年スペンサー・マイルズを指名した時、マイナーの成績ページを開いて「まさかこの選手のはずがない」と言った。だから何が起きるか分からない!"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
