      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "The Orioles added outfielder Enrique Bradfield Jr., infielder Aron Estrada, and right-handers Michael Forret, Nestor German, Patrick Reilly, Braxton Bragg and Levi Wells to the 40-man roster. Yaqui Rivera traded to Athletics for minor league righty Josiah Romeo",
